<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><Template xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"><Guid>65cad739-146c-43f2-b0d0-ad62806af524</Guid><Name>Microsoft Azure Virtual Machine</Name><DisplayName>Microsoft Azure Virtual Machine</DisplayName><Description>Use this API Poller template to monitor Microsoft Azure VM performance and statistics counters, including CPU, traffic, and disk metrics.

Prerequisites:
- Use the following parameters to specify the API endpoint in the request URL: ${SUBSCRIPTION_ID}, ${USERGROUP_ID} and ${VM_NAME}
- Configure OAuth 2.0 Azure credentials with the following scope: https://management.azure.com/.default

Data is polled every 2 minutes by default.

API reference: https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-monitor/essentials/metrics-supported#microsoftcomputevirtualmachines (© 2021, Microsoft Corp., available at docs.microsoft.com, obtained on May 3, 2021)

The API reference above might be helpful to customize the API Poller. There are many other metrics available for monitoring.

Instruction how to import the API Poller: https://documentation.solarwinds.com/en/success_center/sam/content/sam-api-poller-import.htm

